{"4106640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Idle D", "steam_appid": 4106640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle D is an idle RPG. Take control of a lone, bald hero as he faces hordes of demons. Enjoy the game's addictive gameplay and familiar isometric graphics, which draw inspiration from classic ARPG titles such as Diablo and Titan Quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/a7f3f531238221de49500f1eb56e4be3.poster.avif?t=1786432291\" width=640 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/a7f3f531238221de49500f1eb56e4be3.webm?t=1786432291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/a7f3f531238221de49500f1eb56e4be3.mp4?t=1786432291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Itemization</strong> - The heart of any ARPG game. Many types of armor, jewelry, charms, weapons with different qualities, any item can turn you from easy prey to ferocious warrior.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics</strong> - Enter the grim isometric world of Idle D and venture to its deepest corners, from deadly deserts to snowy mountain tops. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Mechanic</strong> - There is no need to fight hordes of demons alone; your hero can fight independently. Even if your hero is killed, they will be revived and continue to fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big numbers</strong> - Forget about +3% damage increments. Here, weapons and skills double or triple your damage or even more. And it all stacks multiplicatively.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebirth</strong> - Perform a dark ritual and sacrifice everything but your own life to unlock godly powers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPCs</strong> - Merchants in town sell some nice loot to help you in your quest. Remember that every coin you spend can have a significant impact on your hero and their fighting style, so be sure to visit the vendors. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure</strong> - You never know what you'll find in the various chests scattered across the realm. You might find armor pieces, weapons, gems, potions and other items to make your build unique. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound</strong> - Dark ambient music accompanies you as you adventure into the shadow realms of Idle D. Enjoy it while planning your build, fighting enemies or just relaxing in town.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal monsters and bosses</strong> – Don't expect an easy ride! The enemies in Idle D are relentless. Each monster poses a lethal threat, pushing you to your limits as you refine your tactics and perfect your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/c4641a36855ef5791d194e125e3441f7.poster.avif?t=1786432291\" width=518 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/c4641a36855ef5791d194e125e3441f7.webm?t=1786432291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/c4641a36855ef5791d194e125e3441f7.mp4?t=1786432291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle D is an idle RPG. Take control of a lone, bald hero as he faces hordes of demons. Enjoy the game's addictive gameplay and familiar isometric graphics, which draw inspiration from classic ARPG titles such as Diablo and Titan Quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/a7f3f531238221de49500f1eb56e4be3.poster.avif?t=1786432291\" width=640 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/a7f3f531238221de49500f1eb56e4be3.webm?t=1786432291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/a7f3f531238221de49500f1eb56e4be3.mp4?t=1786432291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Itemization</strong> - The heart of any ARPG game. Many types of armor, jewelry, charms, weapons with different qualities, any item can turn you from easy prey to ferocious warrior.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics</strong> - Enter the grim isometric world of Idle D and venture to its deepest corners, from deadly deserts to snowy mountain tops. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragrap