"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/c4641a36855ef5791d194e125e3441f7.poster.avif?t=1786432291\" width=518 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/c4641a36855ef5791d194e125e3441f7.webm?t=1786432291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/extras/c4641a36855ef5791d194e125e3441f7.mp4?t=1786432291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Idle D is an idle RPG in which a lone hero battles hordes of demons, drawing inspiration from the loot-driven ARPG systems of Diablo and the brutal, desperate tone of the Berserk manga. Auto-battle through shadow-haunted realms, improve your hero, and create a unique build to destroy your enemies.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/2c59e604396fc4e46047b0ba5f569faae0f06bf3/header.jpg?t=1786432291", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/35f6b2ae02cc85600ee612dab3b3da14f09dd91f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786432291", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106640/35f6b2ae02cc85600ee612dab3b3da14f09dd91f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786432291", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8, Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB av